    {
      "id": "source_and_scope",
      "type": "layout.comment",
      "name": "Source, setup and scope",
      "description": "Disabled PointCloud2 subscriber on /opencv_dataflow/camera/points; domain 71, localhost, best-effort/volatile. Declare incoming XYZ units explicitly. Cloud output projects finite XYZ/RGB/normals; the Message output retains all fields and bytes, including intensity/IDs/descriptors. Header frame_id is not TF calibration. Optional raw relay is also disabled; Message mode preserves unknown fields, padding and exact bytes on /opencv_dataflow/demo/observed_points. No simulator, robot or native visualization service is launched.",
